  "summary": "The API exposes a /runcode endpoint accepting POST or GET requests with languageType, optional variables, and code fields, currently supporting only Python. A GET /image/<filename> endpoint retrieves image data stored in the database, and /runcode responses can include an images map of URLs plus captured output.",
